# 📧 AI Email Assistant (n8n)

An automated **AI-powered email triage assistant** built in [n8n](https://n8n.io). It watches a shared inbox, summarises every incoming email with GPT, drafts a ready-to-send reply, and lets an employee decide what happens next — **bin it, forward it, or respond** — all from a single email with a built-in form. Every handled enquiry is logged to Airtable for a full audit trail.

> Built as a portfolio project to demonstrate practical workflow automation, AI integration, and human-in-the-loop design.

## 📌 About

Shared inboxes are noisy — most incoming mail needs the same three decisions: ignore it, pass it on, or reply. This workflow automates the repetitive part (reading, summarising, drafting) while keeping a human firmly in control of the final action.

## ✨ Features

- 📥 **Inbox monitoring** — watches a shared mailbox for new mail in real time
- 🤖 **AI summarisation** — GPT condenses each email into a quick-read summary
- ✍️ **Auto-drafted replies** — a ready-to-send response is generated for every enquiry
- ✅ **Human-in-the-loop** — one email with an embedded form lets a person **bin, forward, or respond** with a single click
- 🗂️ **Audit trail** — every handled enquiry is logged to Airtable for tracking and accountability

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Tool | Role |
|---|---|
| [n8n](https://n8n.io) | Workflow orchestration |
| GPT (OpenAI) | Email summarisation & reply drafting |
| Email (IMAP/SMTP or provider node) | Inbox monitoring & sending |
| [Airtable](https://airtable.com) | Logging & audit trail |

## 🔄 How It Works

```
New Email Arrives
        │
        ▼
 GPT Summarises Email
        │
        ▼
 GPT Drafts Reply
        │
        ▼
 Notification Sent to Employee
 (with summary + draft + action form)
        │
        ▼
   Employee Chooses:
   🗑️ Bin   ➡️ Forward   ✅ Respond
        │
        ▼
  Action Executed + Logged to Airtable
```

## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- An [n8n](https://n8n.io) instance (self-hosted or cloud)
- An OpenAI API key
- An email account with IMAP/SMTP access (or supported provider credentials)
- An Airtable account with a base set up for logging

### Setup

1. Clone this repo:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/your-username/ai-email-assistant.git
   ```
2. Import the workflow JSON into your n8n instance.
3. Add your credentials in n8n:
   - Email (IMAP/SMTP)
   - OpenAI
   - Airtable
4. Update the Airtable base/table IDs to match your own setup.
5. Activate the workflow.

## 📋 Example Use Case

A customer support inbox receives dozens of enquiries a day. Instead of an employee reading each one from scratch, they receive a single notification containing:

- A short AI-generated summary
- A drafted reply, ready to edit or send
- Three buttons: **Bin**, **Forward**, **Respond**

One click handles the enquiry — and it's automatically logged for future reference.

## 🎯 Why This Project

This workflow was built to demonstrate:

- Practical, real-world AI integration (not just a chatbot demo)
- Human-in-the-loop design that keeps people in control of AI output
- End-to-end automation thinking — trigger, processing, decision, logging

